---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="NYSERTA Demo | Smokeless Heat Blog" description="Vedolux demo at Nyserta Renewable Heat Training.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
        <p class="text-ember text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Events</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl">NYSERTA Demo</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6 text-charcoal/90 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Vedolux demo at NYSERTA Renewable Heat Training.
        </p>

        <p>
          The Vedolux Lambda boiler was shown at the <a href="https://www.nyserda.ny.gov/All-Programs/Programs/Become-a-Contractor/Renewable-Heating-and-Cooling/Renewable-Heat-NY-Contractors" class="text-ember hover:underline">NYSERTA training</a> in October 2019 at Delhi State University of New York. The class was taught by John Siegenthaler and is part of the requirement for wood and pellet boiler installers before they can help their customers tap into the available grant money in the <a href="https://www.nyserda.ny.gov/All-Programs/Programs/Renewable-Heat-NY" class="text-ember hover:underline">Renewable Heat NY</a> program. If you are an installer in NY and would like to use the Vedolux boiler for an install that will be applying for grant money, please call us and we will help you become approved for the Vedolux product line.
        </p>

        <img src="https://smokelessheat.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/IMG_0003-1024x768-1.jpg" alt="Vedolux Lambda boiler at NYSERTA training" class="w-full border border-wood/20" />

        <p class="text-sm text-wood mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-wood/20">
          Originally published: October 2019
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
